B.S3=new A.Z("",'This Privacy Policy explains how Star Ludo Royale ("the Game", "we") handles personal data. It is written to comply with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act) and the Information Technology Act, 2000 of India.')
B.RN=new A.Z("1. Offline play collects nothing","vs Computer and Pass & Play work without an account and without the internet. Your nickname, settings and saved match stay only on your device.")
B.S7=new A.Z("2. What we collect for online play","When you use Play Online, we create an online profile and process:\n\u2022 A random ID generated by the app (not your phone's hardware ID, IMEI or advertising ID)\n\u2022 The display name and avatar you choose\n\u2022 If you link Google: your Firebase/Google account identifier and, at sign-in only, your Google display name. We do not store your email address, photo or contacts.\n\u2022 Game data: matches played, wins, captures, virtual coins and gems, and match records (room code, players, winner, time)\n\u2022 Technical data: IP address and connection logs, kept briefly for security and to prevent abuse")
B.Rw=new A.Z("3. Why we use it","Only to run online matches, keep your progress, show the public leaderboard (display name, avatar, wins and games played), keep the game fair and secure, and answer your requests. We never sell your data, show ads, or use it for profiling or tracking.")
B.Rv=new A.Z("4. Consent","We process this data on the basis of your consent, given when you choose to use online features. You can withdraw consent at any time by deleting your online account (Profile \u2192 Delete my online account). Offline play remains available.")
B.RG=new A.Z("5. Children","Online features are meant for users aged 18 or over, or under-18 users with the verifiable consent of a parent or guardian. If you are a parent and believe your child gave us data without consent, contact us and we will delete it.")
B.RF=new A.Z("6. Who processes data for us","Our cloud hosting provider (servers and database) and, if you link Google, Google Firebase Authentication. They act on our instructions and may store data on servers in or outside India, with appropriate safeguards.")
B.RK=new A.Z("7. How long we keep it","Your online profile is kept until you delete it. Deleting removes your profile, coins, gems and stats immediately. Past match records keep only an internal ID that no longer links to you. Security logs are kept for a short period.")
B.Ry=new A.Z("8. Security","Data travels over encrypted connections. Access to our servers is restricted. No system is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable security safeguards as required by the DPDP Act.")
B.RH=new A.Z("9. Your rights","You can access and correct your data (Profile), erase it (Delete my online account), withdraw consent, nominate another person to exercise your rights, and raise a grievance with us. If you are not satisfied with our reply, you may approach the Data Protection Board of India.")
B.RD=new A.Z("10. Changes","If we change this policy, we will update the effective date and show the new version in the app before it applies.")
B.RW=new A.Z("11. Contact / Grievance Officer","[Your name or company name]\nEmail: [your-support-email@example.com]\n[Your city], India")
B.M2=s([B.S3,B.RN,B.S7,B.Rw,B.Rv,B.RG,B.RF,B.RK,B.Ry,B.RH,B.RD,B.RW],t.Wy)
B.a2h=new A.G5(B.M2,null)
B.Rq=new A.Z("","By playing Star Ludo Royale you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Game.")
B.RA=new A.Z("1. Entertainment only \u2014 no real money",'\u2022 Star Ludo Royale is a free online social game, offered only for entertainment and recreation.\n\u2022 There is no entry fee, deposit, betting, wagering, cash prize or prize of any kind.\n\u2022 Coins and gems are virtual points that only work inside the Game. They cannot be bought, sold, transferred, exchanged or redeemed for money, goods or anything of value, and have no monetary value.\n\u2022 The Game is not an "online money game" under the Promotion and Regulation of Online Gaming Act, 2025.')
B.S5=new A.Z("2. Accounts","Online play uses a guest profile linked to your device, which you may link to Google. You are responsible for activity on your account. One person should not use multiple accounts to gain an advantage.")
B.Sb=new A.Z("3. Fair play",'In online matches the server rolls the dice randomly and checks every move; its result is final. Demo rooms are the only exception: they display a "DEMO MODE" banner to every player from the waiting room onward, and in them the dice favour the named player. Do not cheat, modify the app, use bots or exploits, or disrupt other players. Leaving an online match counts as a loss.')
B.RR=new A.Z("4. Conduct","Use a display name that is not offensive, misleading or impersonating anyone. In-game chat is limited to fixed phrases. We may rename, suspend or delete accounts that break these Terms.")
B.RV=new A.Z("5. Ownership","Ludo is a traditional board game. The Star Ludo Royale name, logo, artwork, sounds and code belong to [Your name or company name]. The Game is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to any other Ludo app or its owners.")
B.S_=new A.Z("6. No warranty",'The Game is provided "as is" and "as available". We do not promise it will be error-free or always online. Online features may change or be discontinued.')
B.RJ=new A.Z("7. Limitation of liability","To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from use of the Game, including loss of progress or virtual items. Because the Game is free and involves no money, our total liability is limited to INR 0. Nothing here limits liability that cannot be limited under Indian law.")
B.RS=new A.Z("8. Changes and termination","We may update the Game or these Terms. Continuing to play after an update means you accept the new Terms. You may stop using the Game and delete your account at any time.")
B.RT=new A.Z("9. Governing law","These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts at [Your city], India have exclusive jurisdiction.")
B.RI=new A.Z("10. Contact","[Your name or company name] \xb7 [your-support-email@example.com]")
B.LC=s([B.Rq,B.RA,B.S5,B.Sb,B.RR,B.RV,B.S_,B.RJ,B.RS,B.RT,B.RI],t.Wy)
